      <span class="h5">Unleash Your Creativity with Vartheme BS5</span>
      <p><a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/varbase">Varbase</a> Design System is your all-in-one solution for modern web theming, powered by Vardot’s Vartheme BS5 Starterkit. Built on <a href="https://getbootstrap.com">Bootstrap 5</a> and <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/drupal/releases/11.1.6">Drupal ~11</a>, it harnesses Single Directory Components (SDC) and <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/ui_patterns">UI Patterns ~2.0</a> to deliver a fresh, efficient theming experience. With Varbase Components, you can manage and customize your site’s design with ease, perfect for creating standout websites.</p>
